  "description": "UQOLIZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H34 F84 N8 O34 Yb6. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb5B (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 0.661-3.778 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 16.48-111.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C88H34F84N8O34Yb6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
